                <div class="tr-node"><span>├─ VertexDedicatedEndpoint</span><code>/v1/systemone (~155 ms warm GPU)</code></div>
                <div class="tr-node tr-node--new"><span>└─ HesitationGate</span><code>H_raw=0.062 &lt; 0.16 → 200 OK</code></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 2: INTERACTIVE CONFIDENCE BEYOND SHANNON & PRE-FUSION GATE SIMULATOR -->
    <section class="sec sec--split" id="confidence">
      <div class="rl-copy">
        <span class="sec-eyebrow">Confidence Beyond Shannon</span>
        <h2>Normalize across K. Always gate before fusing priors.</h2>
        <p>
          Raw Shannon entropy (<code>H = -∑ p_i ln p_i</code>) grows with option count <code>ln K</code>: a 2-option boolean gate maxes out at <code>0.693 nats</code> while a 52-option choice reaches <code>3.951 nats</code>. <strong>dgem</strong> normalizes hesitation onto <code>[0, 1]</code> via <code>raw_normalized_entropy = H / ln K</code> and separates Stage 2 cascade gating from empirical prior fusion.
        </p>
        <ul class="rl-points">
          <li><strong>Scale-free hesitation bands</strong> — <code>&lt; 0.16 Clear</code> (fast-path exit), <code>0.16–0.50 Somewhat unsure</code>, and <code>&gt; 0.50 Very unsure</code> across any <code>K</code>.</li>
          <li><strong>Pre-fusion cascade gate</strong> — try switching the simulator to <code>always</code> with low <code>p_top</code>: an un-gated strong prior artificially depresses post-fusion entropy below <code>0.16</code>! <strong>dgem</strong> gates Stage 2 strictly on pre-fusion <code>raw_normalized_entropy</code> and fuses priors with <code>--prior-gate-mode hesitant</code> (<code>decisionindex.FusePriorWithGateMode</code>).</li>
          <li><strong>Wide-option catalogs (<code>K &gt; 26</code>)</strong> — combine <code>--labels az_aa</code> / <code>az_lower</code> (up to 52 options), <code>--bracket-size 20</code> two-stage tournaments, or <code>--shortlist-topk M</code> (<code>decisionindex.PriorLogitsShortlist</code>).</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="rl-cta">
          <a class="link-arrow" href="/dgem/confidence/overview/">Confidence Beyond Shannon →</a>
          <a class="link-arrow" href="/dgem/practitioners-guide/">Practitioner Guide →</a>
          <a class="link-arrow" href="/dgem/visualizer.html">Full Concept Visualizer →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- INTERACTIVE ENTROPY & PRIOR GATE LAB -->
      <div class="slab" data-shannon-lab aria-label="Interactive normalized entropy and prior gate simulator">
        <div class="slab-hdr">
          <strong>Interactive Pre-Fusion Hesitation &amp; Prior Gate Lab</strong>
          <span class="win-pill">τ = 0.16 Threshold</span>
        </div>

        <div class="slab-controls">
          <div class="slab-ctrl">
            <label><span>Option Count (K)</span><span>Scales ln(K)</span></label>
            <div class="slab-k-btns" role="group" aria-label="Select option count K">
              <button type="button" class="slab-pill" data-k="2">K=2</button>
              <button type="button" class="slab-pill" data-k="4">K=4</button>
              <button type="button" class="slab-pill" data-k="10">K=10</button>
              <button type="button" class="slab-pill is-active" data-k="26">K=26</button>
              <button type="button" class="slab-pill" data-k="52">K=52</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="slab-ctrl">
            <label><span>--prior-gate-mode</span><span>FusePriorWithGateMode</span></label>
            <div class="slab-mode-btns" role="group" aria-label="Select prior gate mode">
              <button type="button" class="slab-pill" data-pmode="off">off</button>
              <button type="button" class="slab-pill is-active" data-pmode="hesitant">hesitant ★</button>
              <button type="button" class="slab-pill" data-pmode="proportional">proportional</button>
              <button type="button" class="slab-pill" data-pmode="always">always (naive)</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="slab-ctrl">
          <label for="slab-ptop-range"><span>Stage 1 Top-Option Probability</span><span data-ptop-lbl>p_top = 0.58</span></label>
          <input id="slab-ptop-range" class="slab-range" type="range" min="0.15" max="0.97" step="0.01" value="0.58" data-ptop>
        </div>

        <div class="slab-meters">
          <div class="smeter">
            <div class="smeter-lbl">Raw Shannon H</div>
            <div class="smeter-val" data-m-shannon>1.982 nats</div>
            <div class="smeter-track"><div class="smeter-fill" data-m-shannon-bar style="width:50%"></div></div>
            <div class="smeter-sub" data-m-shannon-sub>Max ln(26) = 3.26 nats</div>
          </div>
          <div class="smeter">
            <div class="smeter-lbl">Pre-Fusion H_raw (Gate)</div>
            <div class="smeter-val" data-m-hraw>0.608</div>
            <div class="smeter-track"><div class="smeter-fill" data-m-hraw-bar style="width:60%"></div></div>
            <div class="smeter-sub" data-m-hraw-sub>Very unsure (&gt; 0.50)</div>
          </div>
          <div class="smeter">
            <div class="smeter-lbl">Post-Fusion H_norm</div>
            <div class="smeter-val" data-m-hpost>0.312</div>
            <div class="smeter-track"><div class="smeter-fill" data-m-hpost-bar style="width:31%"></div></div>
            <div class="smeter-sub" data-m-hpost-sub>Mode: hesitant</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="slab-verdict is-warn" data-slab-verdict></div>
      </div>
    </section>

